@page "/doctors-practice-demo"

<PageTitle>A doctor's practice's agent · louis-agent</PageTitle>
<PageHead Description="Watch a doctor's practice's website agent answer a worried parent without giving medical advice, and pass an appointment request on, recorded once and played back." />

<BusinessDemo Kicker="A doctor's practice" Business="Graanveld Family Practice" Title="graanveld.example · the agent in the corner" Turns="Conversation"
              Heading="It books the doctor. It never plays one."
              Lede="A parent asks Graanveld Family Practice what to give a feverish child. The agent doesn't advise. It says when to call an ambulance, and books an appointment.">
    <Points>
        <li><strong>It never gives medical advice.</strong> Not what it is, not what to take. In an emergency it gives the numbers to call.</li>
        <li><strong>It knows the practice.</strong> The hours, the doctors, the fee and what to bring.</li>
        <li><strong>It asks before it sends.</strong> The request goes to reception only after the parent says yes, with no more about their health than they offer.</li>
    </Points>
</BusinessDemo>
